  <name>Chelotype</name>
  <summary>PTY-backed GTK terminal</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Chelotype is a GTK terminal experiment backed by one real PTY and
      libghostty-vt as the terminal-core state.
    </p>
    <p>
      It renders Ghostty grid and cell snapshots through a custom GTK renderer,
      supports tabs and split panes, and can open terminals on the host or in
      toolbox and podman containers.
    </p>
  </description>
